WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.522
Filmed something, but didn't say a word at the time?

2
00:00:05.622 --> 00:00:09.202
Tap plus, then Add a video from your camera roll.

3
00:00:10.702 --> 00:00:14.593
It lands on the day you filmed it, not the day you added it.

4
00:00:16.493 --> 00:00:21.065
Open it, tap Record your voice-over, and talk while it plays.

5
00:00:23.165 --> 00:00:26.385
Keep it, and that day has your voice on it.

6
00:00:27.085 --> 00:00:32.062
Want the room back? Slide in the sound you filmed, under your voice.

7
00:00:34.962 --> 00:00:44.262
Sunday morning. Blanket, coffee, and nowhere I had to be.
